cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Filiation in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Filiation: a citation graph and research library that runs on your own computer"
abstract: >-
  Filiation builds a research library from one paper. It follows the reference
  lists through OpenAlex, records every citation as an edge, keeps the legal
  open-access PDFs, extracts their text, and finds passages by keyword with
  their page. It records the sentence in which each paper cites another, and
  serves the library to AI assistants over the Model Context Protocol so that
  their answers quote passages the researcher can check. It runs locally as a
  desktop app and a command-line tool, with no account and no server.
authors:
